#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Infrastructure > Storage` is for adding and managing Storage Buckets, "
"File Shares, Volumes, Data Stores and Storage Servers for use with other "
"Services in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"`Infraestructura > Almacenamiento` es para adding y managing "
"Almacenamiento Buckets, Archivo Shares, Volumes, Datos Stores y "
"Almacenamiento Servidores para usar con otro Servicios en |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:12
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:12
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:14
msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Role Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:16
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are two Role permissions for the `Infrastructure > Storage` "
"section: `Infrastructure: Storage` and `Infrastructure: Storage Browser`."
" `Infrastructure: Storage` gives Full, Read, or No access to the "
"`Infrastructure > Storage` sections. `Infrastructure: Storage Browser` "
"controls file access for Buckets, File Shares, and supported HVM file-"
"based Data Stores. Full `Infrastructure: Storage Browser` permission "
"allows upload and deletion when the user also has Full access to the "
"corresponding storage resource. Read permission allows browsing and "
"download when the user also has at least Read access to that resource."
msgstr ""
"Hay son two Rol permisos para el `Infraestructura > Almacenamiento` "
"sección: `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento` y `Infraestructura: "
"Almacenamiento Browser`. `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento` dar Completo, "
"Read o No acceso al `Infraestructura > Almacenamiento` sections, mientras"
" `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento Browser` es específico a `Buckets` y "
"`Files Shares`. Completo `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento Browser` "
"permisos permite `Buckets` y `Files Shares` a be browsed y archivos y "
"folders a be agregado, downloaded y eliminado desde el `Buckets` y `Files"
" Shares`. Read `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento Browser` permisos permite"
" `Buckets` y `Files Shares` a be browsed solo."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:19
msgid "Default Storage"
msgstr "Predeterminado Storage"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:21
msgid ""
"The default Storage path for Virtual Images, Backups, Deployment "
"Archives, Archive Service, and Archived Snapshots is `var/opt/morpheus"
"/morpheus-ui/`. Its is recommended to add Storage Buckets and File Shares"
" for these targets in the `Infrastructure > Storage` section to avoid "
"running out of disk space on the |morpheus| Appliance."
msgstr ""
"El predeterminado Almacenamiento ruta para Virtual Imágenes, Backups, "
"Despliegue Archives, Archive Servicio, y Archived Snapshots es "
"`var/opt/morpheus/morpheus-ui/`. Su es recomendado a agregar "
"Almacenamiento Buckets y Archivo Shares para estos targets en el "
"`Infraestructura > Almacenamiento` sección a avoid ejecutando out de "
"disco space en el |morpheus| Appliance."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/buckets.rst:2
msgid "Storage Buckets"
msgstr "Storage Buckets"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/buckets.rst:4
msgid ""
"Storage Buckets are for Backup, Archives, Deployment and Virtual Images "
"storage targets. Buckets can be browsed and files and folders can be "
"uploaded, downloaded or deleted from the Bucket section. Retention "
"Policies can be set on Storage Buckets for files to be deleted or backed "
"up to another bucket after a set amount of time."
msgstr ""
"Almacenamiento Buckets son para Backup, Archives, Despliegue y Virtual "
"Imágenes storage targets. Buckets puede be browsed y archivos y folders "
"puede be uploaded, downloaded o eliminado desde el Bucket sección. "
"Retention Policies se puede establecer en Almacenamiento Buckets para "
"archivos a be eliminado o backed hasta another bucket después de un "
"establecer amount de tiempo."

